2026-10-15T08:00:01.5
2026-10-15T08:00:01,123456789
2026-10-15 08:00:01Z
2026-10-15T08:00:01+02
2026-10-15T08:00:01+0200
2026-10-15T08:00:01+02:00
2026-10-15T08:00:01+02:00:30
2026-10-15T08:00:01-05:30
2026-10-15T08:00:01+00:00
2026-10-15T08:00:01-00:00
2026-10-15x08:00
